encoding  utf-8
# A new survey trip in LongwoodValleySink. SexyTopo (set up for the
# house style) exports most of this; use this file to check what it
# wrote, or as a start when it did not. A trip X lives in
# LongwoodValleySink/X/X.th, with its plan drawing X.plan.th2 and its
# sketches in X/Notes/. See tools/README.md for the whole workflow and
# tools/sketch2therion/Style.md for the conventions.
#
# Then, in LongwoodValleySink/LongwoodValleySink.th:
#   input X/X.th
#   equate 27@CrystalPitch 1@X        (tie its first station on)
# and add XMP@X to map LongwoodValleySinkMP.

survey NewTrip -title "New Trip"

  # The plan drawing and its map, once converted (tools/sketch2therion)
  # and drawn; Therion stops on a map whose scraps are not input yet.
  # input "NewTrip.plan.th2"
  #
  # map NewTripMP
  #   NewTripSP1
  # endmap

  centreline
    copyright 2026 "CC BY-NC-SA 4.0"

    date 2026.01.01
    team "First Surveyor" notes
    team "Second Surveyor" instruments
    team "Third Surveyor" assistant

    explo-date 2026.01.01
    explo-team "First Surveyor"

    # SexyTopo writes: data normal from to tape compass clino ignoreall
    data normal from to tape compass clino
    1 2 4.21 231.5 -12.0
    2 - 1.10 140.0 3.0
    2 3 3.87 245.0 -4.5

    extend right
  endcentreline
endsurvey
